# PDE Gate Constraints
- Thin CLI (`tools/pde-gate`).
- Hosted API (`tools/pde-gate-api`).
- Rego and OPA run server-side only.
- Organizations never receive the internal `policies/` tree.
- Packages (`--package`) are the client-facing unit.
- Region whitelists via `variables.approved_regions` / `approved_zones`.
- Node 24 runtime.
